/T (Globally, and in the Southeast Asian region, Sri Lanka is one of the countries most affected by dengue infection. In the absence of a specific treatment or an operationally deployed dengue vaccine, improving clinical care for dengue infection is one of the cornerstones of minimising the morbidity and mortality associated with dengue.)
