/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This revised guideline includes new evidence-based concepts and expert recommendations for the management of Dengue Fever \(DF\) and Dengue Haemorrhagic Fever \(DHF\). It highlights the importance of early detection, identifying the estimated time of the onset of plasma leakage, preventing shock and ensuring early detection and management of shock. )
/E (This revised guideline includes new evidence-based concepts and expert recommendations for the management of Dengue Fever \(DF\) and Dengue Haemorrhagic Fever \(DHF\). It highlights the importance of early detection, identifying the estimated time of the onset of plasma leakage, preventing shock and ensuring early detection and management of shock. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
