/T (It is important to detect the above clinical features before the patient goes into DSS. The above features together with a rising trend in the heart/pulse rate, trend in the blood pressure, especially diastolic pressure to rise and narrowing of pulse pressure may indicate intravascular volume depletion and impending DSS. Therefore, close monitoring, proper assessment and appropriate timely action are essential.)
/E (It is important to detect the above clinical features before the patient goes into DSS. The above features together with a rising trend in the heart/pulse rate, trend in the blood pressure, especially diastolic pressure to rise and narrowing of pulse pressure may indicate intravascular volume depletion and impending DSS. Therefore, close monitoring, proper assessment and appropriate timely action are essential.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [5]
>>
