/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (DSS is a medical emergency that needs early recognition and immediate intervention. Failure to recognise impending shock in a patient may lead to shock and other complications. A patient with dengue shock should be managed in a high-dependency area.)
/E (DSS is a medical emergency that needs early recognition and immediate intervention. Failure to recognise impending shock in a patient may lead to shock and other complications. A patient with dengue shock should be managed in a high-dependency area.)
