/E (Therefore, clinicians must notify suspected dengue cases \(Surveillance Case Definitions for Notifiable Diseases in Sri Lanka, 2005\) through the notification system using the web-based National Dengue Surveillance System \(NaDSys\) and the 'Notification of Communicable Diseases' form \(document number - H544\).)
